function sync(a){for(const id of ['date','assessor','notes','discussionNotes','outcome','feedback','signature','signatureDate'])if($('#'+id))a[id]=id==='date'?(parseUKDate($('#'+id).value)||a.date):$('#'+id).value;}
function getDraft(){let a=drafts.get(route.id);if(!a){a=structuredClone(assessments.find(y=>y.id===route.id));drafts.set(route.id,a)}return a;}
